<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GranCare cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GranCare cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Friday it downgraded GranCare Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Late Thursday, GranCare said it restated its second quarter earnings to include an $8 million charge to account for a bad debt allowance for accounts receivable.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/8 to 10-13/16.</p>
</text>
